cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this specification, please cite it as below."
title: "Claude Code First: an evidence-based specification of practice for software written with Claude Code"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Oliveira
    given-names: Alexandre
repository-code: "https://github.com/alegauss/claude-code-first"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
abstract: >-
  A specification of how to run a software project in which Claude Code is the primary
  author and a person governs what is built, derived as a multiple-case study of five
  such projects. Every rule cites graded findings, and every finding cites pointers into
  the projects' pinned sources, which a gate checks.
keywords:
  - Claude Code
  - AI coding agents
  - software engineering practice
  - case study
